<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-org9bf2a49">
<p>
Added transient menu interface
</p>

<p>
Introduced a comprehensive transient menu (<code>dired-video-thumbnail-transient</code>) providing quick access to all commands via <code>.</code> or <code>C-c .</code> in the thumbnail buffer. The menu displays current state (sort order, filters, video count, recursive/wrap mode) and organises commands into logical groups: Navigation, Playback, Sorting, Filtering, Marking, Delete, Display, and Other.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="outline-container-orgc8ac102" class="outline-3">
<h3 id="orgc8ac102"><span class="timestamp-wrapper"><span class="timestamp">&lt;2025-12-15 Mon&gt; </span></span> 0.2.0</h3>
<div class="outline-text-3" id="text-orgc8ac102">
<p>
Enhanced package with sorting, filtering, and docs
</p>

<p>
Added sorting and filtering features to <code>dired-video-thumbnail</code>. Introduced customizable options for sorting and filtering criteria, and implement interactive commands for toggling these settings. Included comprehensive documentation in Texinfo format, covering installation, usage, and customization.
</p>
